THE SMART CITY ISSUE REPORTING & RESOLUTION PROJECT

BRD (Business Requirements Document):
This project implements a Smart City Issue Tracking system within Salesforce using standard configuration tools. Instead of using a public portal, cases are created internally by an administrator using record types for new or reopened issues. The system ensures proper routing, status tracking using assignment rules, validation rules, workflows, and dashboards.
Objective:
The objective of this project is to build a centralized issue tracking system within Salesforce where municipal administrators can log, track, and resolve civic complaints reported by citizens. The system utilizes standard Salesforce automation to route cases to correct departments, trigger status update emails to citizens, enforce business rules around case reopening, and provide real-time dashboard analytics for city management.
Components:
o	Standard Case Object
o	Customized page layout
o	Assignment Rules
o	Workflows
o	Report type
o	Validation rules
o	Email Alerts
o	Custom fields
o	Queues
o	Permission Sets
o	Reports and Dashboards


